{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FdJVcu4yxbkZ4KCrymLGvL","type":"tool_result","content":"=== README.md\n# Pocket Tasks（测试夹具）\n\n一个本地任务提醒原型。用户创建带截止时间的任务；每分钟扫描一次到期任务，并写入通知队列。界面按任务的 `due_at` 排序。\n\n本目录是虚构产品的隔离测试夹具，不属于 hskill 产品源码。\n=== task_service.py\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n\n@dataclass\nclass Task:\n    id: str\n    title: str\n    due_at: datetime\n    completed: bool = False\n    notified: bool = False\n\n\ndef due_notifications(tasks: list[Task], now: datetime) -> list[str]:\n    sent = []\n    for task in tasks:\n        if not task.completed and not task.notified and task.due_at <= now:\n            task.notified = True\n            sent.append(task.id)\n    return sent\n\n\ndef sorted_open_tasks(tasks: list[Task]) -> list[Task]:\n    return sorted((task for task in tasks if not task.completed), key=lambda task: task.due_at)\n=== test_task_service.py\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nfrom task_service import Task, due_notifications, sorted_open_tasks\n\n\ndef test_due_notifications_once():\n    task = Task(\"1\", \"Pay bill\", datetime(2026, 10, 1, 12))\n    assert due_notifications([task], datetime(2026, 10, 1, 12)) == [\"1\"]\n    assert due_notifications([task], datetime(2026, 10, 1, 13)) == []\n\n\ndef test_open_tasks_sort_by_due_at():\n    later = Task(\"2\", \"Later\", datetime(2026, 10, 2))\n    earlier = Task(\"1\", \"Earlier\", datetime(2026, 10, 1))\n    assert sorted_open_tasks([later, earlier]) == [earlier, later]\nlogs\nproject","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2598842c-b6b8-4323-881d-a803822fedc9","uuid":"cb069282-21eb-474b-bf5f-0260a81cf779","timestamp":"2026-10-17T18:05:21.434Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== README.md\n# Pocket Tasks（测试夹具）\n\n一个本地任务提醒原型。用户创建带截止时间的任务；每分钟扫描一次到期任务，并写入通知队列。界面按任务的 `due_at` 排序。\n\n本目录是虚构产品的隔离测试夹具，不属于 hskill 产品源码。\n=== task_service.py\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n\n@dataclass\nclass Task:\n    id: str\n    title: str\n    due_at: datetime\n    completed: bool = False\n    notified: bool = False\n\n\ndef due_notifications(tasks: list[Task], now: datetime) -> list[str]:\n    sent = []\n    for task in tasks:\n        if not task.completed and not task.notified and task.due_at <= now:\n            task.notified = True\n            sent.append(task.id)\n    return sent\n\n\ndef sorted_open_tasks(tasks: list[Task]) -> list[Task]:\n    return sorted((task for task in tasks if not task.completed), key=lambda task: task.due_at)\n=== test_task_service.py\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nfrom task_service import Task, due_notifications, sorted_open_tasks\n\n\ndef test_due_notifications_once():\n    task = Task(\"1\", \"Pay bill\", datetime(2026, 10, 1, 12))\n    assert due_notifications([task], datetime(2026, 10, 1, 12)) == [\"1\"]\n    assert due_notifications([task], datetime(2026, 10, 1, 13)) == []\n\n\ndef test_open_tasks_sort_by_due_at():\n    later = Task(\"2\", \"Later\", datetime(2026, 10, 2))\n    earlier = Task(\"1\", \"Earlier\", datetime(2026, 10, 1))\n    assert sorted_open_tasks([later, earlier]) == [earlier, later]\nlogs\nproject","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
